{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Create fund to celebrate 100th anniversary of women fully achieving the vote",
        "additional_details": "The Government should create a fund of \u00a310million for spending in 2026-2028 to celebrate the 2028 centenary. There would be a limit of \u00a3500,000 that would be spent on any one individual project.  Applications would be made via local MPs. The MP would need to support the project for it to succeed. Projects could be for permanent installations, such as murals or statues, or temporary, such as events",
        "background": "We call on the Government to create a fund of \u00a310million to help celebrate the 100th anniversary of women achieving the vote on equal terms with men in 1928.",
